As follows:
(a) if this Act receives the Royal Assent before 1 July 2015—1 July 2015;
(b) if this Act receives the Royal Assent on or after 1 July 2015—the day after this Act receives the Royal Assent.

As follows:
(a) if this Act receives the Royal Assent before 1 July 2015—immediately after the commencement of section 54 of the Australian Border Force Act 2015;
(b) if this Act receives the Royal Assent on or after 1 July 2015—the day after this Act receives the Royal Assent.
